,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919632109,"data":"PROMPT: How can I make scrambled eggs soft and creamy?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919647812,"data":"BASE: Sure, here are some tips to make scrambled eggs soft and creamy:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919651691,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919654938,"data":"1. **Use a High-Quality Eggs**: Scrambled eggs are best when made with fresh eggs. The yolks will be more creamy and the whites will be more runny.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919658606,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919661718,"data":"2. **Add a Lot of Milk**: Scrambled eggs are best when made with a lot of milk. The creaminess of the milk will help to soften the eggs and make them more creamy.\n"}
