,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919668395,"data":"3. **Add a Lot of Butter**: Butter is a key ingredient in making scrambled eggs creamy. It helps to thicken the mixture and gives it a rich, buttery flavor.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919672009,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919675014,"data":"4. **Add a Lot of Salt**: Adding a lot of salt to the eggs will help to make them more creamy. It will also help to balance out the acidity of the eggs.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919678661,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919681765,"data":"5. **Add a Lot of Pepper**: Adding a lot of pepper to the eggs will help to make them more spicy and creamy.\n"}
