,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.91977781,"data":"PROMPT: What are some common mistakes people make when cooking pasta?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.91978117,"data":"BASE: 1. Not preheating the pan: This can lead to uneven cooking and a less tender pasta.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919784684,"data":"\n"}
