,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919794171,"data":"3. Not stirring the pasta: This can cause it to stick together and become tough.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919802568,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919805274,"data":"4. Not checking the pasta: This can lead to overcooking or undercooking.\n"}
