,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919839265,"data":"6. Not checking the pasta before serving: This can lead to overcooking or undercooking.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919843335,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":6777.919846924,"data":"7. Not using the right cooking liquid: This can affect the texture and flavor of the dish.\n"}
